OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Amurder after body discovered in flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after the body of a 53-year-old
OL,8,Fwas found inside a flat in the early
OL,9,Fhours of Saturday.
OL,11,FPolice were called to Llys Watling on
OL,12,FLondon Road in Holyhead, Anglesey, at
OL,13,Fabout 02:40 where the man was
OL,14,Fdiscovered and pronounced dead at the
OL,15,Fscene.
OL,17,FA 33-year-old man has been arrested in
OL,18,Fconnection with the incident and
OL,19,Fremains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
